                  "id": "choosing-day-cab-or-sleeper-p0",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the first questions our sales team asks is how far your trucks go before they come home. That answer usually decides between a day cab and a sleeper.",
                    "width": "prose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "choosing-day-cab-or-sleeper-h1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When a day cab makes sense",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "choosing-day-cab-or-sleeper-p2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Local and regional work where drivers are home every night: lighter tare weight, better manoeuvrability in tight yards and a lower purchase price.",
                    "width": "prose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "choosing-day-cab-or-sleeper-h3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you need a sleeper",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "choosing-day-cab-or-sleeper-p4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Over-the-road lanes with overnight stops. Sleeper size is a balance between driver comfort, which helps retention, and weight and length limits.",
                    "width": "prose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "choosing-day-cab-or-sleeper-p5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not sure? Tell us about your lanes and we will spec a truck around them.",
                    "width": "prose"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
